Create Windows installer/zip script.

Package the Windows standalone build into an installer (NSIS/WiX) or
distributable zip file.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Script produces Windows-ready zip or installer
- [ ] Includes executable, samples, and required DLLs
- [ ] Works on Windows 10/11 without additional installs
- [ ] Installer creates Start Menu shortcut (if NSIS/WiX)
- [ ] Zip version runs directly after extraction

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build on Windows (MinGW cross-compile or native MSVC)
- [ ] Run installer/extract zip on clean Windows machine
- [ ] Verify application launches and produces audio
